WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.831 --> 00:00:04.500
MORE TALKS WITH NORTH KOREA, AND

00:00:03.899 --> 00:00:04.800
THEN SOME.

00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.036
CHRIS.

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:08.337
&gt;&gt; Chris: THANK YOU, GREG.

00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:11.473
NOW LET'S GET REACTION TO THE

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:13.075
SUMMIT FROM REPUBLICAN

00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:15.377
SENATOR TOM COTTON OF ARKANSAS.

00:00:13.209 --> 00:00:16.345
THE IRAQ WAR VETERAN IS A MEMBER

00:00:15.511 --> 00:00:18.881
OF THE SENATE ARMED SERVICES'

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:19.315
COMMITTEE AND HE JOINS US FROM

00:00:19.014 --> 00:00:21.283
CAPITOL HILL.

00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:24.386
SENATOR, FROM THE VERY START YOU

00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:26.288
HAVE BEEN IN YOUR OWN WORDS

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.922
DEEPLY SKEPTICAL OF

00:00:26.422 --> 00:00:28.257
NORTH KOREA'S INTENTIONS.

00:00:27.056 --> 00:00:29.859
NOW THAT IT'S OVER, WHAT YOU

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.559
THINK OF THE SUMMIT AND THE

00:00:29.992 --> 00:00:34.463
AGREEMENT THAT PRESIDENT TRUMP

00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:35.130
AND KIM JONG UN SIGNED?

00:00:34.597 --> 00:00:35.931
&gt;&gt; CHRIS, FIRST, THANKS FOR

00:00:35.264 --> 00:00:39.468
HAVING ME ON TO DISCUSS THIS

00:00:36.065 --> 00:00:40.603
INCREDIBLE DAY.

00:00:39.602 --> 00:00:41.871
I THINK THIS WAS AN IMPORTANT

00:00:40.736 --> 00:00:43.339
FIRST STEP BUT WE HAVE TO

00:00:42.004 --> 00:00:43.639
REMEMBER IT WAS ONLY A FIRST

00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:46.141
STEP.

00:00:43.772 --> 00:00:48.143
I AM SKEPTICAL OF KIM JONG UN'S

00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:51.280
COMMITMENT TO DENUCLEARIZING

00:00:48.277 --> 00:00:52.481
NORTH KOREA.

00:00:51.413 --> 00:00:53.182
I KNOW SECRETARY POMPEO HAS

00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:55.284
ARTIE LEFT FOR SOUTH KOREA AND

00:00:53.315 --> 00:00:56.051
THEN HE WILL BE IN CHINA

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:58.254
TOMORROW.

00:00:56.185 --> 00:01:01.090
NOW IT'S TIME TO NEGOTIATE THE

00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:02.458
NITTY-GRITTY DETAILS OF

00:01:01.223 --> 00:01:03.125
VERIFIABLY AND IRREVERSIBLY THE

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:05.361
NUCLEAR RISING NORTH KOREA

00:01:03.259 --> 00:01:06.662
PRESIDENT TRUMP HIMSELF SAID, IT

00:01:05.494 --> 00:01:08.297
MAY NOT WORK OUT BUT THEY HAD TO

00:01:06.795 --> 00:01:09.298
SIT DOWN AND HAVE DISAGREEMENT

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:12.301
FACE-TO-FACE BEFORE WE COULD

00:01:09.431 --> 00:01:13.068
MOVE ONTO THE NEXT STAGE OF OUR

00:01:12.434 --> 00:01:16.071
NEGOTIATIONS.

00:01:13.202 --> 00:01:18.040
&gt;&gt; Chris: IN THE AGREEMENT,

00:01:16.205 --> 00:01:19.875
KIM COMMITS TO "THE COMPLETE

00:01:18.173 --> 00:01:20.476
DENUCLEARIZATION OF THE KOREAN

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:22.011
PENINSULA."

00:01:20.609 --> 00:01:24.046
WE WILL HAVE TO WAIT AND SEE

00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:24.780
WHAT HE DOES IN TERMS OF

00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:28.450
NORTH KOREA, BUT ARE YOU

00:01:24.914 --> 00:01:30.019
CONCERNED THAT HE IS DEMANDING

00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:32.655
THAT ON OUR SIDE WE FOLD THE

00:01:30.152 --> 00:01:33.389
NUCLEAR UMBRELLA WE HAVE HAD FOR

00:01:32.788 --> 00:01:36.759
DECADES PROTECTING SOUTH KOREA

00:01:33.522 --> 00:01:40.262
AND JAPAN.

00:01:36.892 --> 00:01:41.430
&gt;&gt; NO, I'M NOT CONCERNED THAT

00:01:40.396 --> 00:01:42.631
THE PRESIDENT WOULD WITHDRAW

00:01:41.563 --> 00:01:44.500
THAT UMBRELLA FROM ANY OF OUR

00:01:42.765 --> 00:01:47.069
ALLIES.

00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:47.803
KIM JONG UN HOLDS THE ONLY

00:01:47.202 --> 00:01:49.071
NUCLEAR WEAPONS THAT ARE ON THE

00:01:47.937 --> 00:01:50.572
PENINSULA AND THAT IS ONE THING

00:01:49.204 --> 00:01:52.841
THAT IS SUCH A THREAT NOT ONLY

00:01:50.706 --> 00:01:54.443
TO SOUTH KOREA AND JAPAN AND THE

00:01:52.975 --> 00:01:56.412
AMERICAN CITIZENS, BUT TO THE

00:01:54.576 --> 00:01:58.547
UNITED STATES NOW THAT

00:01:56.545 --> 00:02:00.683
KIM JONG UN HAS MISSILES THAT

00:01:58.681 --> 00:02:01.617
CAN REACH THE UNITED STATES.

00:02:00.816 --> 00:02:04.486
PART OF THE LONG-STANDING

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:05.487
AMERICAN POLICY IS THAT WE HAVE

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.255
A NUCLEAR ARSENAL PART TO

00:02:05.621 --> 00:02:07.756
PROTECT OURSELVES AND OUR ALLIES

00:02:06.388 --> 00:02:09.258
SO THEY DON'T FEEL THE NEED TO

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.959
OBTAIN NUCLEAR WEAPONS.

00:02:09.391 --> 00:02:12.962
I FEAR THAT SOUTH KOREA AND

00:02:10.092 --> 00:02:14.630
JAPAN AND TAIWAN WOULD WANT TO

00:02:13.095 --> 00:02:15.297
OBTAIN NUCLEAR WEAPONS IF WE

00:02:14.763 --> 00:02:18.067
WEREN'T WORKING TOWARDS THE

00:02:15.431 --> 00:02:19.868
DENUCLEARIZATION OF NORTH KOREA.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.471
&gt;&gt; Chris: THOUGHT, SENATOR, AS

00:02:22.604 --> 00:02:27.142
PRESIDENT TRUMP ANNOUNCED THAT

00:02:23.339 --> 00:02:28.277
HE IS GOING TO END JOINT U.S.

00:02:27.276 --> 00:02:28.677
MILITARY EXERCISES WITH

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.046
SOUTH KOREA.

00:02:28.811 --> 00:02:33.782
DO YOU THINK THAT'S A GOOD IDEA?

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:35.985
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT SAID THEY WERE

00:02:33.916 --> 00:02:37.019
PAUSING THEM FOR THE TIME BEING.

00:02:36.118 --> 00:02:39.722
WE JUST HAD THE BIGGEST SINGLE

00:02:37.152 --> 00:02:40.556
EXERCISE EACH YEAR OCCURS IN THE

00:02:39.855 --> 00:02:41.857
SPRING THAT PROBABLY WON'T

00:02:40.689 --> 00:02:43.826
HAPPEN FOR ANOTHER NINE OR TEN

00:02:41.991 --> 00:02:45.995
MONTHS UNTIL THE SPRING OF 2019.

00:02:43.959 --> 00:02:47.296
I THINK WE WILL HAVE A PRETTY

00:02:46.128 --> 00:02:49.665
GOOD READ ON WHETHER KIM JONG UN

00:02:47.429 --> 00:02:50.866
IS GOING TO KEEP HIS COMMITMENT

00:02:49.798 --> 00:02:51.600
UNTIL THEN.

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:56.105
SAID HE WAS AWARE OF THE

00:02:53.102 --> 00:02:56.872
SUSPENSION AND HE SUPPORTS THE

00:02:56.238 --> 00:02:58.073
DECISION.

00:02:57.006 --> 00:02:59.475
REGULAR, EVERYDAY TRAINING

00:02:58.207 --> 00:03:00.642
EXERCISES WILL OCCUR.

00:02:59.608 --> 00:03:01.877
SECRETARY MATTIS WOULDN'T HAVE

00:03:00.776 --> 00:03:02.678
SUPPORTED THE DECISION IF YOU

00:03:02.011 --> 00:03:03.846
WEREN'T CONFIDENT THAT OUR

00:03:02.811 --> 00:03:04.480
TROOPS WOULD BE FULLY READY TO

00:03:03.979 --> 00:03:07.182
DEFEND OUR INTEREST ON THE

00:03:04.613 --> 00:03:10.085
KOREAN PENINSULA.

00:03:07.316 --> 00:03:11.020
&gt;&gt; Chris: PRESIDENT TRUMP SAYS

00:03:10.219 --> 00:03:14.857
THAT HE MAY START EASING

00:03:11.153 --> 00:03:17.526
SANCTIONS ON NORTH KOREA, EVEN

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:19.428
BEFORE IT ENDS ITS ENTIRE

00:03:17.659 --> 00:03:21.130
NUCLEAR PROGRAM, COMPLETELY

00:03:19.561 --> 00:03:21.697
DENUCLEARIZE, OFFERING THIS

00:03:21.263 --> 00:03:22.865
EXPLANATION.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.666
TAKE A LOOK.

00:03:22.998 --> 00:03:25.901
&gt;&gt; I THINK WE WILL DO IT AS FAST

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.368
AS IT CAN BE DONE

00:03:26.035 --> 00:03:28.270
SCIENTIFICALLY.

00:03:26.502 --> 00:03:29.304
AS FAST AS I CAN BE DONE

00:03:28.404 --> 00:03:31.073
MECHANICALLY.

00:03:29.438 --> 00:03:31.907
I DON'T THINK -- I MEAN, I'VE

00:03:31.206 --> 00:03:33.475
READ HORROR STORIES, IT'S A 15

00:03:32.041 --> 00:03:35.277
YEAR PROCESS.

00:03:33.609 --> 00:03:36.879
ASSUMING YOU WANTED TO DO IT

00:03:35.411 --> 00:03:38.447
QUICKLY, I DON'T BELIEVE THAT.

00:03:37.012 --> 00:03:38.747
I THINK WHOEVER WROTE THAT IS

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.084
WRONG.

00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:43.752
BUT THERE WILL BE A POINT AT

00:03:42.217 --> 00:03:47.689
WHICH WHEN YOU ARE 20% THROUGH

00:03:43.886 --> 00:03:49.691
YOU CAN'T GO BACK.

00:03:47.923 --> 00:03:50.259
&gt;&gt; Chris: AS A MEMBER OF THE

00:03:49.825 --> 00:03:51.860
SENATE ARMED SERVICES'

00:03:50.392 --> 00:03:54.196
COMMITTEE, CAN YOU EXPLAIN WHAT

00:03:51.994 --> 00:03:57.266
THAT MEANS WHEN YOU ARE 20%

00:03:54.329 --> 00:03:59.268
THROUGH YOU CAN'T GO BACK?

00:03:57.399 --> 00:04:00.235
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK THAT WE SHOULD

00:03:59.401 --> 00:04:01.804
RELAX SANCTIONS IN ANY WAY UNTIL

00:04:00.369 --> 00:04:04.106
WE ARE FAR DOWN THE PATH IF NOT

00:04:01.937 --> 00:04:04.840
AT THE END OF THE ROAD OF

00:04:04.239 --> 00:04:05.741
NORTH KOREA'S DENUCLEARIZATION.

00:04:04.973 --> 00:04:09.678
I THINK THE PRESIDENT WAS USING

00:04:05.874 --> 00:04:10.579
THAT NUMBER AS AN EXAMPLE.

00:04:09.812 --> 00:04:12.915
HE WILL HAVE TO OPEN HIS COUNTRY

00:04:10.712 --> 00:04:14.483
