00:04:17.419 --> 00:04:20.456
DEVELOP STEPS TO REMOVE THOSE

00:04:19.588 --> 00:04:21.123
NUCLEAR MATERIALS AND CERTIFIED

00:04:20.589 --> 00:04:22.357
AND DENUCLEARIZE.

00:04:21.256 --> 00:04:24.059
THE PRESIDENT IS RIGHT THAT ONCE

00:04:22.491 --> 00:04:25.727
YOU GET FAR ENOUGH DOWN THAT

00:04:24.193 --> 00:04:26.295
ROAD IT WOULD BE VERY HARD TO

00:04:25.861 --> 00:04:29.264
REVERSE THOSE STEPS.

00:04:26.428 --> 00:04:29.865
WE SHOULD NOT RELAX SANCTIONS UP

00:04:29.398 --> 00:04:31.300
FRONT.

00:04:29.998 --> 00:04:33.268
THAT'S ONE REASON WHY I WAS

00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:34.870
