00:04:33.402 --> 00:04:35.737
BECAUSE WE WERE RELAXING

00:04:35.003 --> 00:04:37.706
SANCTIONS, GIVING CONCESSIONS ON

00:04:35.871 --> 00:04:38.941
THE FRONT END FOR AN EASILY

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:41.643
REVERSED PROMISES AS OPPOSED TO

00:04:39.074 --> 00:04:45.380
GETTING CONCRETE ACTION FROM OUR

00:04:41.777 --> 00:04:45.881
ADVERSARY AND THEN TAKING ACTION

00:04:45.514 --> 00:04:49.852
INTO THAT PROCESS.

00:04:46.014 --> 00:04:52.654
&gt;&gt; Chris: IN THE MEANTIME, THE

00:04:49.985 --> 00:04:53.555
PRESIDENT SAYS THAT HE IS GOING

00:04:52.788 --> 00:04:54.456
