00:05:02.598 --> 00:05:05.167
SOME OF ITS TIGHT CONTROLS ON

00:05:04.433 --> 00:05:09.671
ACTIVITY ACROSS THE BORDER.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:10.472
IT SEEMS THAT SOUTH KOREA IS

00:05:09.805 --> 00:05:12.608
ANXIOUS TO BEGIN TRADE WITH

00:05:10.606 --> 00:05:17.479
NORTH KOREA AND THE QUESTION I

00:05:12.741 --> 00:05:19.882
HAVE IS HAS BY NORMALIZING

00:05:17.613 --> 00:05:20.883
THINGS, APPEARING HERE, MEETING

00:05:20.015 --> 00:05:22.784
WITH PRESIDENT MOON OF

00:05:21.016 --> 00:05:24.386
SOUTH KOREA, MEETING WITH CHINA,

00:05:22.918 --> 00:05:25.621
AS KIM JONG UN ALREADY SUCCEEDED

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.223
TO SOME DEGREE IN WEAKENING THE

00:05:25.754 --> 00:05:29.258
