00:05:31.093 --> 00:05:33.495
OF THE WORLD?

00:05:32.027 --> 00:05:34.696
&gt;&gt; NO, I DON'T THINK HE HAS.

00:05:33.629 --> 00:05:36.298
CHINA HAS ALWAYS DISPLAYED A

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:37.232
