00:05:36.431 --> 00:05:38.734
NORTH KOREA ON THE ONE HAND

00:05:37.366 --> 00:05:40.302
SAYING THEY WANT TO DENUCLEARIZE

00:05:38.867 --> 00:05:42.538
NORTH KOREA BUT ON THE OTHER

00:05:40.435 --> 00:05:43.539
HAND PROPPING UP THE REGIME

00:05:42.671 --> 00:05:43.939
ECONOMICALLY, FINANCIALLY AND

00:05:43.672 --> 00:05:45.541
POLITICALLY.

00:05:44.072 --> 00:05:47.309
THEY REALLY ONLY CAME TO THE

00:05:45.674 --> 00:05:48.377
