00:05:47.442 --> 00:05:51.513
BECAUSE OF THE PRESIDENT'S

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:52.281
APPROACH SINCE LAST JANUARY.

00:05:51.647 --> 00:05:53.682
THE SOUTH KOREAN ADMINISTRATION

00:05:52.414 --> 00:05:55.684
THAT TOOK OFFICE EARLIER THIS

00:05:53.815 --> 00:05:56.518
YEAR SIMPLY HAD A DIFFERENT

00:05:55.817 --> 00:05:56.985
APPROACH THAN PREVIOUS

00:05:56.652 --> 00:05:59.521
ADMINISTRATIONS.

00:05:57.119 --> 00:06:00.289
THE PRESIDENT HAS DONE A

00:05:59.655 --> 00:06:01.490
