I HOPE THE PRESIDENT IS RIGHT.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:10.759
BUT BECAUSE THE KIM REGIME, BOTH

00:07:09.625 --> 00:07:12.894
KIM JONG UN AND HIS FATHER AND

