00:07:14.029 --> 00:07:16.498
WE NEED TO CONTINUE OUR PRESSURE

00:07:15.597 --> 00:07:17.299
CAMPAIGN, WE NEED TO HOLD

00:07:16.632 --> 00:07:19.101
KIM JONG UN TO HIS COMMITMENTS.

00:07:17.432 --> 00:07:19.968
I THINK WE WILL FIND OUT IN A

00:07:19.234 --> 00:07:22.004
MATTER OF MONTHS WHETHER HE'S

